PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with your device private key.

Copy your device's private key here. The contents must be an unencrypted PEM private
key:

-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
...base64...
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----

WARNING: this key is compiled into the firmware image. Use a per-device key and
treat the resulting binary as a secret. For production, source the key from the
ESP32 secure element / flash encryption instead of embedding it.
